.git
.github
docs
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store

# Python 服务：本地 venv、字节码缓存、测试与基线生成工具都不进镜像
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
services/*/tests
services/logcluster/tools

# 本地跑出来的模板树状态同样不进镜像
services/*/.state

# 权重不进构建上下文：Python 服务在镜像里按摘要自己取回（TimesFM 1.32 GB、
# Laya 678 MB），带上就等于让每次构建都上传一遍这几个 G。
#
# **不能写成 services/*/models**：OCR 的权重是随仓库交付的小模型（39 MB），
# services/ocr/Dockerfile 里有 `COPY services/ocr/models`，把它一起排掉会让
# 镜像构建直接失败（failed to compute cache key: "/services/ocr/models": not found）。
# 新增取权重的服务时在这里加一行。
services/forecast/models
services/jev/models

services/ocr/target

# Only the release binary is needed from the build directory. The parent
# directory must be excluded with a wildcard for the re-includes to work.
target/*
!target/release
target/release/*
!target/release/ocr-service
